      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1187531665,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The realloc makes sense to me. For long lived scopes using finalize with realloc is fine.\n\nI think the problem with using realloc is that it is kind of dangerous because it could leave other pointers to the string dangling.",
